### Code Implementation
The Analytics component is correctly imported and rendered in the main application entry point:

```typescript
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/react"

createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(
  <StrictMode>
    <BrowserRouter>
      <Routes>
        <Route path="/" element={<App />} />
        <Route path="/unlimited" element={<UnlimitedPage />} />
        <Route path="*" element={<NotFoundPage />} />
      </Routes>
    </BrowserRouter>
    <Analytics />  // ✅ Properly placed at root level
  </StrictMode>,
)
```

