## Next Steps

To enable data collection in production:

1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Navigate to your Vercel project dashboard
3. Go to Analytics section
4. Click the "Enable" button to activate Web Analytics
5. Analytics will start collecting data once enabled on the Vercel dashboard

The code implementation is complete and ready for production use.

## Notes

- The Analytics component is lightweight and will not affect application performance
- Data collection only occurs when the application is deployed and Analytics is enabled on Vercel
- In development mode, Analytics runs in development mode (no data sent to production)
- The implementation follows React best practices with the component placed at the root level
